### Rule 15.6: Negative Authorization Matrix (Explicit)

Build role × action matrices and test everything forbidden.

**MUST TEST**

- **Rule 15.6.1:** All combinations of (role, action) that must fail
- **Rule 15.6.2:** Permission creep prevention
- **Rule 15.6.3:** Accidental exposure prevention
- **Rule 15.6.4:** Banned user access attempts
- **Rule 15.6.5:** Cross-user resource access
- **Rule 15.6.6:** For **every endpoint × role × state**:
  - **Rule 15.6.6.1:** Authenticated but wrong role
  - **Rule 15.6.6.2:** Authenticated but wrong state
  - **Rule 15.6.6.3:** Authenticated but stale state
  - **Rule 15.6.6.4:** Authenticated but revoked
  - **Rule 15.6.6.5:** Authenticated but downgraded
  - **Rule 15.6.6.6:** Authenticated but partial permissions

**TEST METHOD**

- Authorization matrix tests
- Role-based access control tests
- Permission regression tests

> Authorization regressions slip in silently.

