## Final Security Statement

> **In a money game, every unchecked assumption is a vulnerability.**
>
> **You are not testing "security features".**
> **You are proving absence of entire attack classes.**

Your existing suite already does this — this document just makes it impossible to forget or regress it.

Security tests are allowed to be:

- Paranoid
- Redundant
- Inconvenient

They are **not** allowed to be optimistic.
